  "other_facts": "Number of dementia cases: 1,335. P values: omega-6 <0.001, omega-3 0.81, omega-6/omega-3 ratio 0.55. AD-PRS was a strong predictor of incident dementia. Joint analyses showed modest attenuation of absolute genetic risk at higher omega-6 concentrations. Findings robust across multiple sensitivity analyses. Multivariable-adjusted Cox proportional hazards models used. Dose-response relationships and both additive and multiplicative interactions with AD-PRS evaluated. Plasma fatty acids quantified by standardized NMR spectroscopy. Incident dementia identified through linked hospital admission and death registry records.",
